<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT HUNTER INVITATION XI BY 25 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT HUNTER INVITATION XI BY 25 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>NEWCASTLE, Australia 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Hunter Invitation XI by 25 runs on Monday in a limited-overs tour match reduced to 32 overs a side because of rain.</p>
<p>Scores - Pakistan 186 for nine in 32 overs (Zahoor Elahi 69); Hunter Invitation XI 161 all out in 31.2 overs (Saqlain Mushtaq five for 28).</p>
